TegraExplorer.bin is the 4.2.0 release of
https://github.com/suchmememanyskill/TegraExplorer
(GPL-2.0, based on Lockpick_RCM / Hekate).
Do not replace this with souldbminerr/TegraExplorer_update until that
fork publishes a bin that still auto-runs sd:/startup.te and fits in
amsBpc IRAM (0x2F000). PackUpdater reboot-to-payload is file-copy only.

Lockpick_RCM.bin is fetched at pack-build time from
https://github.com/impeeza/Lockpick_RCMDecScots (Hekate Payloads menu).
Releases may attach the raw payload or only a zip (plain or *_Hekate.zip).
The pack script accepts either and ignores Lockpick_RCM_unc.bin, which is
the pre-loader build and not a Hekate payload.

ams_bpc.c / ams_bpc.h are from Atmosphère-NX (GPL-2.0),
via aio-switch-updater's copies.

PackUpdater writes sd:/startup.te then reboots into TegraExplorer so
atmosphere/package3.aio and stratosphere.romfs.aio are copied over the
live files before Atmosphere starts — same strategy as AIO Switch Updater.
